flowchart LR
  Onboard[Provider onboarding] --> Verify[Profile / business / KYC readiness]
  Verify --> Create[Create listing]
  Create --> Evidence[Photos / documents / requirements]
  Evidence --> Submit[Submit for review]
  Submit --> Publish[Authorized verification / publication]
  Publish --> Booking[Review eligible booking]
  Booking --> Turnover[Agreement / turnover]
  Turnover --> Return[Return inspection]
  Return --> Claims[Claims / disputes]
  Claims --> Views[Ledger / payout / marketing views]
